meta {
  name: Enable 2FA
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/v1/auth/2fa/enable
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Returns `secret`, `backup_codes`, and `provisioning_uri` — paste the `provisioning_uri`
  into any TOTP app (Google Authenticator, Authy, ...) or a QR-code generator to scan it,
  then use the 6-digit code it produces in `Verify 2FA`. Next password login through
  `oidc/1`'s form will then ask for a 2FA code too.
}
